rts":[{"text":"இல","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"do not have"}],"gloss":"do not have"},{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"மன்ற","gloss":"surely"}],"gloss":"surely"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"யாம்","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"eyes indeed"},{"surface":"நாண்","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"நாண்","gloss":"shame/modesty"}],"gloss":"shame/modesty"},{"surface":"ஏர்பு","parts":[{"text":"ஏர்பு","lemma":"ஏர்","gloss":"rising/accepting"}],"gloss":"rising/accepting"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சினைப்பசும்","parts":[{"text":"சினைப்பசும்","lemma":"சினைப்பசும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பாம்பின்","parts":[{"text":"பாம்பின்","lemma":"பாம்பின்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சூன்முதிர்ப்","parts":[{"text":"சூன்முதிர்ப்","lemma":"சூன்முதிர்ப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பன்ன","parts":[{"text":"பன்ன","lemma":"பன்ன","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கனைத்த","parts":[{"text":"கனைத்த","lemma":"கனை","gloss":"grown thick/dense"}],"gloss":"grown thick/dense"},{"surface":"கரும்பின்","parts":[{"text":"கரும்பு","lemma":"கரும்பு","gloss":"sugarcane"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the sugarcane"},{"surface":"கூம்பு","parts":[{"text":"கூம்பு","lemma":"கூம்பு","gloss":"closed/budding"}],"gloss":"closed/budding"},{"surface":"பொதி","parts":[{"text":"பொதி","lemma":"பொதி","gloss":"sheath/casing"}],"gloss":"sheath/casing"},{"surface":"அவிழ","parts":[{"text":"அவிழ","lemma":"அவிழ","gloss":"to open/unravel"}],"gloss":"to open/unravel","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நுண்","parts":[{"text":"நுண்","lemma":"நுண்","gloss":"fine/minute"}],"gloss":"fine/minute","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உறை","parts":[{"text":"உறை","lemma":"உறை","gloss":"drizzle/drop"}],"gloss":"drizzle/drop"},{"surface":"அழி","parts":[{"text":"அழி","lemma":"அழி","gloss":"abundant/showering"}],"gloss":"abundant/showering"},{"surface":"துளி","parts":[{"text":"துளி","lemma":"துளி","gloss":"drops"}],"gloss":"drops"},{"surface":"தலைஇய","parts":[{"text":"தலைஇய","lemma":"தலைஇய","gloss":"having showered/poured"}],"gloss":"having showered/poured"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தண்","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்","gloss":"cool"}],"gloss":"cool","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வரல்","parts":[{"text":"வரல்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"coming"},{"surface":"வாடையும்","parts":[{"text":"வாடை","lemma":"வாடை","gloss":"north wind"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the north wind"},{"surface":"பிரிந்திசினோர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"பிரிந்திசினோர்க்கு","lemma":"பிரிந்திசினோர்க்கு","gloss":"to those who have separated"}],"gloss":"to those who have separated","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அழலே","parts":[{"text":"அழல்","lemma":"அழல்","gloss":"fire"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"fire indeed"}]}],"literal":"Without shame surely are our eyes, rising with desire, / like the mature pregnancy of a green snake with eggs, / the closed sheaths of the dense sugarcane opening up, / as the fine drizzle of abundant drops showers down, / the cool-coming north wind is to those who have separated like fire indeed.","translation":"My eyes surely have no shame. Rising with desire, they look out. As the fine drizzle of abundant drops showers down, the closed sheaths of the dense sugarcane open up, looking like the mature pregnancy of a green snake. In this season, the cool-coming north wind is like burning fire indeed to those who are separated from their lovers.","modern":"என் கண்கள் நிச்சயமாக நாணமற்றவை. அவை ஆசையோடு எதிர்நோக்குகின்றன. கருவுற்ற பச்சைப் பாம்பின் முதிர்ந்த சூலைப் போல, அடர்ந்த கரும்பின் மூடிய மொட்டுகள் அவிழ்ந்து மலருமாறு, நுண்ணிய துளிகளாகிய மழை பொழிகிறது. இத்தகைய குளிர்ச்சியான வாடைக்காற்று, தலைவனைப் பிரிந்து வாழ்பவர்களுக்கு நெருப்பைப் போலத் துன்பம் தருவதாக உள்ளது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her companion (tōḻi) during the cold season when her lover is away. She laments that her eyes have lost all modesty, remaining wide open and looking out for his return instead of sleeping. The poet uses a striking visual image from the Marutham (agricultural) landscape: the closed sheaths of the sugarcane opening up under the fine drizzle are compared to the swollen belly of a pregnant green snake. This fertile, blooming landscape contrasts sharply with the heroine's inner desolation. The cool north wind (vāṭai), which usually brings comfort, feels like a burning fire to her in her state of separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}